/ locals: current_server
.card
  .card-body.text-center.py-5
    i.bi.bi-controller.display-4.text-info.mb-3.d-block
    h4.mb-2 Join #{current_server.server_id} first
    p.text-muted.mx-auto style="max-width: 34rem;"
      | You need to join the server in game before you can use any of this.

    button.btn.btn-outline-secondary[
      type="button"
      title=server_address(current_server)
      data-controller="clipboard"
      data-action="click->clipboard#copy"
      data-clipboard-text-value=server_address(current_server)
    ]
      i.bi.bi-clipboard.me-1
      span[data-clipboard-target="label"] Copy connection
